## brief This manual is for PADDOCS (1.1.0, 2025-10-25) A module which self-generates documentation

## desc 
## Paddocs is a module for PADS which self generates documentation from code into a technical manual, blog, info, and man pages.
## This documentation was generated using the same library. You can generate the book layout into the `~/dev/pads/paddocs/` directory.
## Write the documentation within the programs files using the headers outlined in [Notes](#notes-1). Build the documentation with `-b`, then generate the docs with `-g`.
## You can also use `paddocs` to generate report templates, metadata for the book, covers, bibliography info. etc.
## end desc

